OL,3,AWoman drugged and advertised for sex by
OL,4,Ahusband speaks out as abusers found
OL,5,Aguilty
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who was drugged, raped and
OL,8,Fadvertised for sex online by her
OL,9,Fhusband has said she will "never feel
OL,10,Fcompletely safe" after four men were
OL,11,Ffound guilty of sexually abusing her,
OL,12,Fin the first trial of its kind in the
OL,13,FUK.
OL,15,FJoanne Young, who has waived her right
OL,16,Fto anonymity, said: "The person I
OL,17,Ftrusted most in the world betrayed me
OL,18,Fin the most horrific way."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
