OL,3,AWoman drugged and advertised for sex by
OL,4,Ahusband speaks out as abusers found
OL,5,Aguilty
OL,6,
OL,7,FPhilip Young, 50, had already pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to multiple charges of drugging
OL,9,Fand raping his wife over a 13-year
OL,10,Fperiod at their home in Swindon,
OL,11,FWiltshire. He invited men via websites
OL,12,Fand apps such as Craigslist, Grindr and
OL,13,FFab Swingers to the couple's home
OL,14,Fwithout her knowledge.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
