OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump, Putin and Xi release 'peace
OL,4,Adeclaration' after historic meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the declaration, they said "nuclear
OL,7,Fwar cannot be won and must never be
OL,8,Ffought" and that the countries planned
OL,9,Fto increase the production and supply
OL,10,Fof petroleum. They also said they were
OL,11,F"committed to reform the UN" to respond
OL,12,Fmore effectively to global challenges.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
